<p>You learn new techniques for setting traps.</p><p>Deploying one of your traps is possible up to 1 grids from you, takes <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 11%, 14%, 17%, 19%</acronym> less time than normal, and has <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1%, 2%, 3%, 4%, 5%</acronym> less chance to break stealth.</p>